    "detailed_description": "Capture surreal, photorealistic pictures as you explore a strange, abstract world in this relaxing art-game experience that combines minimalist game design with cutting-edge technology.<br />\r\nThe photos you take are transformed into lifelike images by utilising NVIDIA's GauGAN2 machine learning, it only takes a few seconds to see the results.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSave, edit, and share your favourite photos as a souvenir of your journey!",
